flowchart LR
  accTitle: EPIC processor timing and resource bottlenecks
  accDescr: A teaching reconstruction of EPIC with perceptual, cognitive, and motor processor paths. Some activities overlap, while shared queues and a constrained motor channel delay operations that need the same resource.
  P[Perceptual processor] --> Q1[Perceptual queue]
  C[Cognitive processor] --> Q2[Cognitive queue]
  M[Motor processor] --> Q3[Motor queue]
  Q1 --> C
  C -->|decision| M
  M --> O[Environment response]
  C -->|shared capacity| B[Resource bottleneck]
  Q1 --> B
  Q2 --> B
  B --> S[Scheduled execution]
  S --> O
